      "content": "12.1 Education in Arunachal Pradesh"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Overview of the state's socio-cultural development through Education and Media in Arunachal Pradesh.",
        "Documentation of traditional heritage including Art Forms, Handicrafts, Music, and Dance.",
