      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Demographic metrics from Census 2011 Key Data are heavily weighted in competitive examinations.",
        "Geographical Indication (GI) Tags registered from Arunachal Pradesh are essential for General Knowledge questions.",
        "Important boundary disputes and strategic sensitivities form key questions in polity and state affairs."
      ],
      "id": "h928evj"
    },
